      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Finding and fixing lock hotspots in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 10959554860068741540,
      "context_hash": 11742217294946908484,
      "translation": "커널의 락 핫스팟 찾기와 해결",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Identifying the problem",
      "source_hash": 5104072619095177583,
      "context_hash": 11981765549346834019,
      "translation": "문제 식별",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Lock contention manifests as CPUs burning time waiting rather than doing useful work.",
      "source_hash": 8556557897274207978,
      "context_hash": 11016413117914638858,
      "translation": "락 경합은 CPU가 유용한 작업을 하지 않고 대기하는 데 시간을 소모하는 형태로 나타납니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "lock contention": "락 경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Symptoms:",
      "source_hash": 17069142794826046854,
      "context_hash": 6442879883006204506,
      "translation": "증상:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "High CPU utilization but low throughput",
      "source_hash": 9308564852256375451,
      "context_hash": 6305182319831401969,
      "translation": "높은 CPU 사용률에 비해 낮은 처리량",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`perf top` shows `_raw_spin_lock` or `mutex_lock` near the top",
      "source_hash": 7432230449675935575,
      "context_hash": 1344942669214475085,
      "translation": "`perf top`에서 `_raw_spin_lock` 또는 `mutex_lock`이 상위에 표시됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`sar -u` shows high `%sys` with low actual work rate",
      "source_hash": 4912555211141465347,
      "context_hash": 7130492413279357518,
      "translation": "`sar -u`에서 `%sys`는 높지만 실제 작업 처리율은 낮음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`perf stat` shows many `lock:contention_begin` events",
      "source_hash": 7513285543002330249,
      "context_hash": 35203340910657381,
      "translation": "`perf stat`에서 `lock:contention_begin` 이벤트가 많이 표시됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "/proc/lock_stat",
      "source_hash": 2269576971579648649,
      "context_hash": 1252158021176777350,
      "translation": "/proc/lock_stat",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Requires `CONFIG_LOCK_STAT=y`.",
      "source_hash": 4035549196998068751,
      "context_hash": 9707598442956904332,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_LOCK_STAT=y`가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Provides per-lock-class contention statistics:",
      "source_hash": 4406177787497173898,
      "context_hash": 11202014098303495161,
      "translation": "락 클래스별 경합 통계를 제공합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "contention": "경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Output format:",
      "source_hash": 14740759533586069588,
      "context_hash": 264626590598390835,
      "translation": "출력 형식:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Key columns:",
      "source_hash": 13217661036199867075,
      "context_hash": 8886212903248963163,
      "translation": "주요 열:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**contentions**: number of times a caller had to wait (lock was already held)",
      "source_hash": 16940168725446094820,
      "context_hash": 9881970664357209189,
      "translation": "**contentions**: 호출자가 대기해야 했던 경합 횟수(락이 이미 점유된 상태)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "contention": "경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:21.483832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**waittime-max**: worst-case wait time (µs) — your tail latency",
      "source_hash": 7082624061321173115,
      "context_hash": 8523647272436318497,
      "translation": "**waittime-max**: 최악의 경우 대기 시간(µs) — 꼬리 지연 시간",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:21.483833Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**holdtime-total**: total time the lock was held — high means long critical sections",
      "source_hash": 9576172945737362512,
      "context_hash": 870337762569555416,
      "translation": "**holdtime-total**: 락을 점유한 총 시간 — 값이 높으면 임계 구역이 길다는 의미",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "critical section": "임계 구역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "**con-bounces**: contentions where the previous holder was on a different CPU (cross-CPU bouncing)",
      "source_hash": 11429560809192238033,
      "context_hash": 1843299313615986137,
      "translation": "**con-bounces**: 이전 점유자가 다른 CPU에 있었던 경합(CPU 간 바운싱)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "contention": "경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
