      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Replace one coarse lock with many per-bucket or per-object locks:",
      "source_hash": 17291895579150341739,
      "context_hash": 12983918458821112634,
      "translation": "하나의 큰 단위 락을 버킷별 또는 객체별의 여러 락으로 대체합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The `____cacheline_aligned` attribute prevents false sharing between adjacent buckets.",
      "source_hash": 15129171801798435303,
      "context_hash": 12458758198519212065,
      "translation": "`____cacheline_aligned` 속성은 인접한 버킷 간의 거짓 공유(false sharing)를 방지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:28.423625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
